14.9. Where the Grant Recipient is a Contracting Authority within the meaning of the Procurement Regulations, the Grant Recipient will comply, as necessary, with the Procurement Regulations when procuring goods and services in connection with the Grant Funding Agreement and the Authority shall not be liable for the Grant Recipient’s failure to comply with its obligations under the Procurement Regulations.

