17.5. The Grant Recipient shall be required to take all possible actions to identify and protect the values of oak trees and to reduce risks to human and animal health associated with Oak Processionary Moth Caterpillars, in line with their responsibilities outlined in the OPM management plan. Actions should also be in line with guidance provided through the OPM Resource Hub - Home (fera.co.uk). The FC cannot accept any responsibility for any harm or injury caused by OPM while Funded Activities are being undertaken.

