24.19. The Grant Recipient shall notify the Authority immediately in writing and as soon as the Grant Recipient is aware (or ought reasonably to be aware) that it is anticipating, undergoing, undergoes or has undergone a Change of Control, in any case within 30 days of completion of the Change of Control, provided such notification does not contravene any Law.

